<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr-wolf-brothers-v36" name="Wolf Brothers - Draft" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules>































<rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000001" name="Wolfborn" hidden="false"><description>When this unit is activated, you may move all models with this rule in it by up to D3 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000002" name="Enhanced Wolfborn" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Wolfborn, it may move by up to 2D3 inches from Wolfborn instead of D3 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000003" name="Nimble" hidden="false"><description>When this unit is activated, you may move all models with this rule in it by up to D3 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000004" name="Enhanced Nimble" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Nimble, it may move by up to 2D3 inches from Nimble instead of D3 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000006" name="Evasive" hidden="false"><description>Enemies suffer -1 to hit against units where most models have this rule.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000007" name="Melee Shrouding" hidden="false"><description>Enemies charging a unit where most models have this rule reduce charge range by 2 inches, minimum 6 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000008" name="Mend" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation before attacking, remove D3 wounds from one friendly Tough model within 3 inches.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00000a" name="Rapid Rush" hidden="false"><description>Add 6 inches to this model's Rush movement.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00000b" name="Re-Deployment" hidden="false"><description>After deployment excluding reserved units, redeploy up to two friendly units. Players alternate, beginning with the next activating player.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00000c" name="Smash" hidden="false"><description>Against targets beyond half weapon range, unmodified Defense rolls of 6 must be rerolled.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00000e" name="Unstoppable Mark" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation before attacking, mark one visible enemy within 18 inches; friendly weapons gain Unstoppable against it for the next applicable instance.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00000f" name="Vanguard" hidden="false"><description>After deployment, reposition fully within 9 inches of the original position and more than 9 inches from enemies without Vanguard.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000010" name="Versatile Expert" hidden="false"><description>On activation choose AP(+1) on weapons or +1 to hit for models with this rule in the unit, until activation ends.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000011" name="Versatile Reach" hidden="false"><description>On activation choose +4 inches shooting range or +2 inches charge movement for models with this rule, until activation ends.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000012" name="Bane in Melee Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Bane on melee weapons.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000013" name="Bane when Shooting Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Bane on ranged weapons.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000014" name="Bravery Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain +1 to Morale tests.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000015" name="Enhanced Wolfborn Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Enhanced Wolfborn.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000016" name="Melee Shrouding Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Melee Shrouding.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000017" name="Rapid Rush Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Rapid Rush.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000018" name="Regeneration Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Regeneration.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000019" name="Versatile Reach Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit gain Versatile Reach.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00001a" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>Armor protection of 2+ while equipped.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00001b" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>Ignore the target's cover protection when attacking.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00001c" name="Wolf Dome (1)" hidden="false"><description>One friendly unit within 12 inches gains Evasive for the next applicable instance.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00001d" name="Godly Thunder (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy model within 18 inches in line of sight, which takes 1 hit with AP(4). Resolve this effect as if the target was a unit of [1].</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00001e" name="Wolf Sight (2)" hidden="false"><description>Up to two visible enemy units within 18 inches are marked; friendly shooting gains Unstoppable against them for the next applicable instance.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-00001f" name="Storm of Power (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12 inches in line of sight, which takes 4 hits with Surge. Roll as many dice as hits to determine whether effects that trigger on rolls of 6 apply.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000020" name="Righteous Fury (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18 inches, which get Enhanced Wolfborn once, the next time the effect would apply.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-clone-000021" name="Wolf Trauma (3)" hidden="false"><description>One visible enemy within 24 inches takes 6 hits with AP(1) and Smash.</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-new-000001" name="Fortified" hidden="false"><description>When units where most models have this rule take hits, those hits count as having AP(-1), to a minimum of AP(0).</description></rule><rule id="opr-wolf-new-000002" name="Armor(3)" hidden="false"><description>This model has an Armor value of 3+ while this rule applies.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries>




























